1
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:05,900
Go, Eren!

2
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:15,760
In the year 850...

3
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:18,679
For the first time,

4
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:21,840
humanity recovered part of its
territory from the Titans.

5
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,530
Though at great cost.

6
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:33,300
Then I welcome everyone
here to the Survey Corps!

7
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,640
This is a true salute!

8
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:37,390
Offer up your hearts!

9
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:40,320
Yes, sir!

10
00:00:44,430 --> 00:00:46,660
You have done well to endure your fear.

11
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:49,570
You are brave soldiers.

12
00:00:50,310 --> 00:00:51,980
You have my heartfelt respect.

13
00:00:53,690 --> 00:00:54,990
A month later,

14
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:59,039
led by Erwin Smith, the
Survey Corps left Karanes

15
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:01,489
to find a route to Zhiganshina,

16
00:01:01,490 --> 00:01:06,540
where it's believed the secrets
of the Titans are held.

17
00:01:12,110 --> 00:01:15,300
We will now begin the 57th
expedition beyond the walls!

18
00:01:16,390 --> 00:01:18,140
Onward!

19
00:01:21,610 --> 00:01:22,970
Oh, my friend!

20
00:01:22,970 --> 00:01:25,490
This is a victory for us!

21
00:01:25,550 --> 00:01:28,650
Our fame starts here!

22
00:01:28,690 --> 00:01:29,750
Oh, my friend!

23
00:01:29,750 --> 00:01:34,950
Let us celebrate this victory for the next battle!

24
00:01:49,590 --> 00:01:55,130
"I died for naught"
I won't let it end like that for you

25
00:01:55,130 --> 00:02:00,390
until I am the last one standing

26
00:02:00,390 --> 00:02:03,370
The enemy is cruel... We will kill...

27
00:02:03,370 --> 00:02:06,410
The enemy is colossal... We will jump...

28
00:02:06,410 --> 00:02:10,050
In our hands we hold blades of glory

29
00:02:10,050 --> 00:02:12,330
and sing in the name of victory

30
00:02:12,330 --> 00:02:16,970
We bear the wings of freedom on our backs

31
00:02:18,290 --> 00:02:24,410
Swearing iron determination upon our hearts,

32
00:02:24,430 --> 00:02:28,950
we slash apart the circle of idiocy

33
00:02:30,530 --> 00:02:32,850
and soar through the sky

34
00:02:32,910 --> 00:02:37,110
with our wings of freedom

35
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:55,980
Female Titan: The 57th Exterior Scouting Mission, Part 1

36
00:03:16,060 --> 00:03:18,380
Ahead, to the left, a 10-meter class!

37
00:03:18,750 --> 00:03:22,260
I am very interested in seeing
what's inside its stomach...

38
00:03:22,990 --> 00:03:24,760
But I'll leave it to the support team!

39
00:03:28,130 --> 00:03:28,890
Damn!

40
00:03:29,350 --> 00:03:30,390
Not deep enough.

41
00:03:31,180 --> 00:03:32,900
Defend the formation!

42
00:03:37,150 --> 00:03:38,440
Stay strong!

43
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:40,830
Leave it to the support
team, and keep going!

44
00:03:43,110 --> 00:03:46,950
Onward! Onward!

45
00:03:52,030 --> 00:03:54,960
The support teams will only
accompany us to the old city area.

46
00:03:55,310 --> 00:03:58,400
Once we're past that,
it's completely Titan territory.

47
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:04,220
The long-range scouting formation devised
by Commander Erwin is our only hope.

48
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:07,610
We, the special ops squad, are here.

49
00:04:10,230 --> 00:04:12,260
Sir, can they...

50
00:04:13,020 --> 00:04:15,150
Can my classmates beat the Titans?

51
00:04:15,570 --> 00:04:16,520
Huh?

52
00:04:16,521 --> 00:04:19,670
What have you been doing the past month?

53
00:04:20,990 --> 00:04:22,939
Listen, brat...

54
00:04:22,940 --> 00:04:24,699
The most crucial part

55
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:27,320
of an expedition is in how
you avoid fighting Titans

56
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:38,170
Go into long-range scouting formation!

57
00:04:40,220 --> 00:04:41,680
See ya, Armin.

58
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:45,050
If you run into a Titan,
don't piss your pants!

59
00:04:45,610 --> 00:04:46,639
Right!

60
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:47,780
Same to you, Jean.

61
00:04:54,406 --> 00:04:55,916
Row 3-3: Relay

62
00:04:55,941 --> 00:04:57,550
The vanguard is to spread
out in a semi-circle.

63
00:04:57,575 --> 00:05:01,215
But stay within visual
range of one another.

64
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,760
Row 5-Center: Standby

65
00:05:02,785 --> 00:05:04,585
Position yourselves at fixed intervals.

66
00:05:04,610 --> 00:05:08,670
Extend the recon and message relay
range as far as possible.

67
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,280
We'll be fine...

68
00:05:34,590 --> 00:05:35,610
Calm down!

69
00:05:40,060 --> 00:05:44,660
It's primarily the forward recon squad
that will encounter Titans.

70
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:55,700
As soon as one is sighted,
they'll fire a red smoke round.

71
00:05:58,860 --> 00:06:03,110
Anyone who sees the flare should fire
the same round to relay the signal.

72
00:06:06,940 --> 00:06:10,179
When the Commander sees it,

73
00:06:10,180 --> 00:06:12,140
he'll fire a green smoke round,

74
00:06:13,670 --> 00:06:16,770
and show the formation where to go.

75
00:06:18,770 --> 00:06:23,519
Thus, the entire formation can advance

76
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:25,860
toward the goal, while avoiding Titans.

77
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:32,989
But sometimes, due to terrain or obstacles,

78
00:06:32,990 --> 00:06:36,120
a Titan won't be sighted until
it's within the formation.

79
00:06:42,890 --> 00:06:44,459
Red... Red...

80
00:06:44,460 --> 00:06:45,920
Red smoke round...

81
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,800
Blause! Over here!

82
00:06:54,190 --> 00:06:56,669
Damn it! Did we let one through?

83
00:06:56,670 --> 00:06:58,060
We'll draw it this way.

84
00:06:58,570 --> 00:07:00,440
Blause, get over here!

85
00:07:11,260 --> 00:07:12,240
I'll handle it!

86
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,190
Split off!

87
00:07:13,190 --> 00:07:14,160
Yes, sir!

88
00:07:32,460 --> 00:07:33,719
Sir...

89
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:35,010
Back into position!

90
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:36,770
He ran out of gas.

91
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:43,610
Something's wrong...

92
00:07:43,940 --> 00:07:46,369
It's been a while since we
saw the red smoke round,

93
00:07:46,370 --> 00:07:47,980
but they still haven't reformed.

94
00:07:48,470 --> 00:07:49,490
It can't be...

95
00:07:50,690 --> 00:07:53,909
Note that this strategy only
works on normal Titans,

96
00:07:53,910 --> 00:07:57,240
whose behavior can be easily predicted.

97
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,660
A black smoke round?

98
00:08:02,290 --> 00:08:04,009
Is a Titan ignoring the nearby humans

99
00:08:04,010 --> 00:08:06,210
and heading for the formation's center?

100
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:08,000
It has to be...

101
00:08:08,450 --> 00:08:09,590
That's

102
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:12,190
an Aberrant!

103
00:08:13,870 --> 00:08:16,849
It's only necessary to fight Aberrants,

104
00:08:16,850 --> 00:08:18,509
whose behavior is unpredictable.

105
00:08:18,510 --> 00:08:21,099
Damn, we'll have to fight it...

106
00:08:21,100 --> 00:08:22,940
Sys, go for the neck!

107
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,899
I'll stop it!

108
00:08:24,900 --> 00:08:26,230
Roger!

109
00:08:28,130 --> 00:08:31,319
Using Maneuver Gear on flat
terrain is a huge disadvantage.

110
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:33,320
It almost never works.

111
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:36,480
But I can't let it disrupt the formation.

112
00:08:37,350 --> 00:08:39,979
I think that's Arlert over there.

113
00:08:39,980 --> 00:08:42,810
I don't want one of the
new guys to run into it.

114
00:08:43,210 --> 00:08:44,370
We kill it here!

115
00:08:52,950 --> 00:08:54,130
Now, Sys!

116
00:09:01,140 --> 00:09:03,270
You did it, Squad Leader Ness!

117
00:09:06,030 --> 00:09:07,190
Did I get him?

118
00:09:09,110 --> 00:09:10,429
You came for me?

119
00:09:10,430 --> 00:09:12,370
That's my partner...

120
00:09:13,210 --> 00:09:15,670
I love you, Shallot!

121
00:09:23,970 --> 00:09:24,990
Again?

122
00:09:25,370 --> 00:09:27,959
What is the right flank recon squad doing?

123
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,869
If it ignored them and came this way,

124
00:09:29,870 --> 00:09:31,620
it must be another Aberrant.

125
00:09:32,490 --> 00:09:33,940
Oh, fine...

126
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:37,009
Sys, we do it again.

127
00:09:37,010 --> 00:09:37,800
Right.

128
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:42,310
But we've got the worst luck,
doing this twice in a row...

129
00:09:42,860 --> 00:09:45,370
And I think it's at least
a fourteen-meter class.

130
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:47,390
This one will be tough.

131
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,209
What's that?

132
00:09:58,210 --> 00:09:59,370
It's too fast!

133
00:09:59,570 --> 00:10:01,329
Don't let it reach Arlert!

134
00:10:01,330 --> 00:10:02,030
Sys!

135
00:10:02,530 --> 00:10:03,570
Right!

136
00:10:37,950 --> 00:10:40,280
No... No.

137
00:10:40,740 --> 00:10:41,920
That's no Aberrant.

138
00:10:42,270 --> 00:10:43,620
It's intelligent!

139
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:46,850
Like the Armored or
Colossal Titans, or Eren...

140
00:10:47,450 --> 00:10:49,830
A human in the body of a Titan!

141
00:10:50,370 --> 00:10:51,330
B-But who?

142
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:52,840
Why?

143
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,800
This is bad! What should I do?

144
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:55,969
I'm going to die, too...

145
00:10:55,970 --> 00:10:56,880
I'll be killed!

146
00:10:58,610 --> 00:11:00,380
Go! Run!

147
00:11:07,870 --> 00:11:09,310
What does it...

148
00:11:11,580 --> 00:11:13,810
No, what do they...

149
00:11:17,110 --> 00:11:18,980
What do they want?

150
00:11:33,220 --> 00:11:35,050
Someone tell them...

151
00:11:36,150 --> 00:11:40,170
That the right flank recon squad
has been wiped out...

152
00:11:40,850 --> 00:11:45,450
A Female Titan brought
a huge Titan army!

153
00:11:47,030 --> 00:11:49,560
Is anyone there?

154
00:12:47,900 --> 00:12:50,160
It's not going to kill me?

155
00:12:50,620 --> 00:12:51,840
Why?

156
00:12:53,040 --> 00:12:55,040
It removed my hood...

157
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:59,740
To... To look at my face?

158
00:13:00,430 --> 00:13:01,310
Armin!

159
00:13:02,520 --> 00:13:03,570
Reiner!

160
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:06,300
Hey, can you stand?

161
00:13:07,040 --> 00:13:11,590
You won't last outside the walls
unless you're on horseback...

162
00:13:11,590 --> 00:13:12,590
Hurry!

163
00:13:12,590 --> 00:13:13,630
Right!

164
00:13:15,870 --> 00:13:18,520
I saw the smoke round
signaling an Aberrant.

165
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:20,970
Was it that one there with the nice ass?

166
00:13:20,970 --> 00:13:22,550
That's no Aberrant...

167
00:13:22,550 --> 00:13:24,600
It's a human in a Titan body!

168
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:26,100
What was that?

169
00:13:27,210 --> 00:13:28,370
Wait a second.

170
00:13:28,370 --> 00:13:29,900
We need to fire a smoke round first.

171
00:13:30,260 --> 00:13:31,500
H-Hurry...

172
00:13:31,750 --> 00:13:33,550
There's an emergency over there.

173
00:13:34,030 --> 00:13:35,110
With a smoke round, I'll...

174
00:13:36,210 --> 00:13:39,330
Wait... I think Jean fired it.

175
00:13:42,370 --> 00:13:44,440
It came from the right flank.

176
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:47,290
Does that mean we're so compromised,
we can't continue the mission?

177
00:13:47,750 --> 00:13:50,590
Looks like the right flank recon
squad was partially wiped out...

178
00:13:50,590 --> 00:13:52,680
Titans, tons of them.

179
00:13:52,680 --> 00:13:53,920
I don't know why,

180
00:13:54,580 --> 00:13:57,050
but there are lots of fast ones.

181
00:13:57,050 --> 00:13:58,860
For now, we're holding them back,

182
00:13:58,860 --> 00:14:00,760
but recon is no longer possible...

183
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:02,870
We've taken heavy losses,

184
00:14:02,870 --> 00:14:04,670
and if we aren't careful,
we'll be destroyed!

185
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:07,310
That Titan came from the same direction.

186
00:14:07,870 --> 00:14:08,730
No way...

187
00:14:09,230 --> 00:14:11,410
Was it leading the Titans?

188
00:14:11,820 --> 00:14:13,030
It?

189
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:16,030
Why is a Titan over there?

190
00:14:16,570 --> 00:14:17,500
An Aberrant?

191
00:14:17,820 --> 00:14:23,500
No, it's a human in a Titan body...

192
00:14:23,500 --> 00:14:25,620
Someone with the same ability as Eren.

193
00:14:25,990 --> 00:14:27,370
What?

194
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:30,060
Why do you think that, Armin?

195
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:33,840
The Titans only eat us.

196
00:14:34,270 --> 00:14:36,520
We're just killed in the process.

197
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:38,800
Killing us isn't ever
specifically their goal.

198
00:14:39,290 --> 00:14:42,060
But when Sys aimed for its weak spot,

199
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:45,520
it crushed him and smashed
him into the ground.

200
00:14:47,030 --> 00:14:50,340
It killed him to kill,
rather than to eat him.

201
00:14:50,780 --> 00:14:53,070
Its nature is different from the others.

202
00:14:53,730 --> 00:14:57,630
When the Colossal and Armored
Titans destroyed the walls,

203
00:14:57,630 --> 00:15:01,330
it must've been the one that
brought that army of Titans.

204
00:15:01,930 --> 00:15:05,130
Their goal has consistently
been to attack all humanity!

205
00:15:06,880 --> 00:15:08,580
No, maybe not.

206
00:15:09,180 --> 00:15:11,720
It felt like it was looking for someone...

207
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:14,970
If that is the case,
could it be looking for...

208
00:15:15,910 --> 00:15:17,760
Could it be looking for Eren?

209
00:15:18,130 --> 00:15:19,800
Eren?

210
00:15:19,800 --> 00:15:24,300
Eren's with Squad Levi, which is
in charge of the right flank.

211
00:15:24,950 --> 00:15:26,230
The right flank?

212
00:15:26,860 --> 00:15:30,870
The plans I got had them
to the rear of the left flank.

213
00:15:32,050 --> 00:15:36,800
Mine said they were near
the front of the right...

214
00:15:37,260 --> 00:15:40,240
Wait, there's no way they'd
be on the front lines.

215
00:15:40,640 --> 00:15:43,120
So where are they?

216
00:15:43,570 --> 00:15:46,800
Probably the safest place in the formation.

217
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:51,790
Which means in the center,
and toward the rear...

218
00:15:52,420 --> 00:15:53,250
Armin!

219
00:15:53,610 --> 00:15:56,010
There's no time to think.

220
00:15:56,280 --> 00:15:59,510
Smoke rounds can't possibly indicate
how much of a threat it poses!

221
00:16:00,100 --> 00:16:02,530
At this rate, it'll wipe out command.

222
00:16:02,530 --> 00:16:05,740
Then the formation will fall apart,
and that'll be the end.

223
00:16:05,740 --> 00:16:07,100
What are you trying to say?

224
00:16:07,510 --> 00:16:08,960
In other words,

225
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:11,830
at this range, we may still be
able to draw its attention.

226
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:15,550
We may be able to buy time to withdraw.

227
00:16:16,110 --> 00:16:19,280
Maybe... Maybe...

228
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:23,990
But it really is intelligent.

229
00:16:24,290 --> 00:16:27,950
To it, we are nothing but
insignificant insects.

230
00:16:27,950 --> 00:16:30,040
It'll just crush us...

231
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:31,560
Seriously?

232
00:16:32,970 --> 00:16:34,540
That's scary...

233
00:16:34,830 --> 00:16:37,830
Hey, are you really Jean?

234
00:16:37,830 --> 00:16:42,050
The Jean I know never thinks
of anyone but himself.

235
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:44,590
Don't be an ass...

236
00:16:46,640 --> 00:16:51,350
I just don't want those charred bones I saw

237
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:53,840
to be disappointed in me!

238
00:16:54,290 --> 00:16:56,640
I...

239
00:16:57,210 --> 00:17:00,040
I know what I have to do now!

240
00:17:00,380 --> 00:17:03,300
And this is the job we chose.

241
00:17:03,300 --> 00:17:04,490
Help me!

242
00:17:10,180 --> 00:17:11,690
Put on your hood.

243
00:17:11,690 --> 00:17:12,810
As far forward as you can...

244
00:17:12,810 --> 00:17:14,830
So that your face is hidden from it.

245
00:17:15,170 --> 00:17:19,780
I don't think it will kill us until
it knows who we are!

246
00:17:19,780 --> 00:17:20,960
Oh...

247
00:17:21,410 --> 00:17:24,770
You believe if it thinks we might
be Eren, it won't kill us?

248
00:17:25,230 --> 00:17:27,350
If nothing else, it'll make me feel better.

249
00:17:27,350 --> 00:17:30,470
Let's just hope it has poor eyesight!

250
00:17:31,280 --> 00:17:36,710
Armin, I thought it was creepy
how you always clung to Eren.

251
00:17:37,150 --> 00:17:38,830
But I've always thought you had it in you.

252
00:17:40,050 --> 00:17:41,570
Uh, thanks.

253
00:17:42,110 --> 00:17:44,820
But "creepy"? That's really mean...

254
00:17:59,590 --> 00:18:02,170
It's going much more slowly
than when I first saw it.

255
00:18:02,590 --> 00:18:03,730
Is it tired?

256
00:18:04,530 --> 00:18:07,150
If it runs at that speed
again, we'll be too late!

257
00:18:07,540 --> 00:18:10,390
Now's our chance... We have to do it now!

258
00:18:16,540 --> 00:18:19,520
Listen up... Remember what I said.

259
00:18:20,310 --> 00:18:22,800
Try to draw its attention
for as long as possible,

260
00:18:22,800 --> 00:18:25,170
to give the formation time to withdraw!

261
00:18:25,170 --> 00:18:27,380
Keep it here as long as you can.

262
00:18:28,410 --> 00:18:31,530
If we could cut its Achilles tendon,
that'd be more than enough.

263
00:18:31,850 --> 00:18:34,450
But don't do anything stupid...

264
00:18:34,450 --> 00:18:35,850
Don't try to kill it!

265
00:18:36,350 --> 00:18:39,080
It's aware of the weak spot on its neck.

266
00:18:39,450 --> 00:18:41,850
It's totally different than other Titans...

267
00:18:41,850 --> 00:18:43,440
It is impossible to kill.

268
00:18:43,870 --> 00:18:48,070
At least, not by any normal human being.

269
00:18:51,460 --> 00:18:52,430
However...

270
00:18:52,430 --> 00:18:54,690
If it's those two... Maybe...

271
00:19:36,040 --> 00:19:36,900
Armin!

272
00:19:39,360 --> 00:19:40,510
This one...

273
00:19:40,510 --> 00:19:42,810
Its movements are much more
precise than the others' are!

274
00:19:42,810 --> 00:19:43,900
Damn it.

275
00:19:43,900 --> 00:19:44,990
I...

276
00:19:45,270 --> 00:19:47,160
I underestimated it!

277
00:19:52,360 --> 00:19:54,130
It protected its neck...

278
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:55,090
Jean!

279
00:19:56,690 --> 00:19:58,960
Damn it! I can't get away!

280
00:19:59,300 --> 00:20:00,220
I'm going to die!

281
00:20:00,740 --> 00:20:02,590
Once it grasps my wire, it's over!

282
00:20:06,010 --> 00:20:07,020
Jean!

283
00:20:07,020 --> 00:20:10,010
Avenge the bastard who rushed to his death!

284
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:12,510
Armin?

285
00:20:13,540 --> 00:20:15,210
It stopped?

286
00:20:15,760 --> 00:20:16,790
That's the one...

287
00:20:16,790 --> 00:20:18,540
That's the one that killed him!

288
00:20:18,540 --> 00:20:21,340
He rushed to his death on the right flank!

289
00:20:21,340 --> 00:20:23,730
Avenge him!

290
00:20:28,933 --> 00:20:29,888
What happened?

291
00:20:31,760 --> 00:20:33,688
Did Armin hit his head and go insane?

292
00:20:33,690 --> 00:20:35,192
This isn't the time...

293
00:20:37,355 --> 00:20:38,333
R-Reiner?

294
00:20:39,520 --> 00:20:42,370
It crushed my best friend!

295
00:20:42,630 --> 00:20:45,330
I saw his body under its foot!

296
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:50,210
He's going straight for the neck?

297
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:51,880
No, it's working!

298
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:54,550
While it's distracted by Armin!

299
00:21:02,430 --> 00:21:04,260
H-Hey...

300
00:21:17,250 --> 00:21:20,690
H-Hey... Reiner, you...

301
00:21:37,810 --> 00:21:40,050
Reiner did it!

302
00:21:40,380 --> 00:21:42,710
Mikasa was so strong, I forgot.

303
00:21:42,710 --> 00:21:45,890
But he's really strong and reliable, too...

304
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:48,820
We've bought enough time, right?

305
00:21:48,820 --> 00:21:50,480
Let's get the hell away from it!

306
00:21:51,080 --> 00:21:54,730
If it isn't a man-eater,
it won't follow us!

307
00:22:03,140 --> 00:22:04,190
Look...

308
00:22:04,190 --> 00:22:08,490
That big bitch got scared
and decided to go home!

309
00:22:09,830 --> 00:22:11,330
No... Why?

310
00:22:12,010 --> 00:22:14,070
That's toward the center rear.

311
00:22:14,640 --> 00:22:15,650
Is it

312
00:22:16,360 --> 00:22:18,080
heading toward Eren?

313
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:41,590
If we suppose that I am not me,

314
00:22:41,590 --> 00:22:46,130
Can you say with certainty that you are you?

315
00:22:46,780 --> 00:22:51,660
Will you be able to pick up after yourself

316
00:22:51,660 --> 00:22:56,810
Once your sand-like shell breaks and your heart crumbles?

317
00:22:57,090 --> 00:23:02,020
I could hear someone calling

318
00:23:02,310 --> 00:23:05,920
But now my ears are just ringing

319
00:23:06,240 --> 00:23:11,080
It's as if time has frozen

320
00:23:11,380 --> 00:23:13,990
Now, wake up

321
00:23:13,990 --> 00:23:18,960
I began to walk through a deep dark abyss

322
00:23:19,510 --> 00:23:24,260
As swift as a gale, I escaped for my life

323
00:23:24,670 --> 00:23:28,830
I felt like a living corpse

324
00:23:29,240 --> 00:23:33,960
We break out of our walls

325
00:23:34,270 --> 00:23:40,350
To reunite in worlds we've yet to map

326
00:23:53,453 --> 00:23:54,537
"You damn monster!"

327
00:23:55,777 --> 00:24:00,200
Not even the highly experienced Survey Corps soldiers can stop the female Titan.

328
00:24:01,170 --> 00:24:05,510
And so, the monster finally spots Eren in a forest of giant trees.

329
00:24:05,510 --> 00:24:06,066
Forest of Giant Trees: The 57th Exterior Scouting Mission, Part 2
And so, the monster finally spots Eren in a forest of giant trees.

330
00:24:06,066 --> 00:24:07,092
Forest of Giant Trees: The 57th Exterior Scouting Mission, Part 2
